  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (2VR:PA01/01, Design & Access Statement dated April 2021; received 29/04/2021, 2VR:PA01revA/02 (Rev A); received 02/07/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The outbuilding hereby approved shall only be used as storage in association with the existing property and shall not be used\r\nas habitable accommodation.\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - Other than as specified on the proposed plans no additional bathroom or kitchen facilities shall be installed in the property without prior consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved building, details of the arrangements for the storing of waste and recycled materials shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority. Thereafter, these arrangements shall be implemented in accordance with the agreed details.",
    "Condition : 7 - The premises shall be used for part commercial (specifically Use Class E(c) and (g) and part residential (Use Class C3) and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Classes B, C and E of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) (Amendment) (England) Regulations 2020, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification)."
